{"3699600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aeon Tempus", "steam_appid": 3699600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Aeon Tempus, you embody a time‑traveling researcher thrust into the crossroads of history. From sun-baked temples to imperial capitals, unveil secrets of real civilizations while confronting political intrigue, religious rites, and philosophical legacies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the main menu evolves with time: its skies brighten and fade with your system’s clock, subtly blurring the line between player and history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historically accurate environments inspired by ancient Egypt, Rome, and beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-based quests and artifact recovery, rooted in real events and figures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic world adaptation: NPCs, rituals, and weather respond to your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic presentation: rich visuals, voice narration, and orchestral score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative choices: affect how history unfolds—play observer or changer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the dusty corridors of time, solve mysteries, and decide whether to preserve history—or transform it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Aeon Tempus, you embody a time‑traveling researcher thrust into the crossroads of history. From sun-baked temples to imperial capitals, unveil secrets of real civilizations while confronting political intrigue, religious rites, and philosophical legacies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the main menu evolves with time: its skies brighten and fade with your system’s clock, subtly blurring the line between player and history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historically accurate environments inspired by ancient Egypt, Rome, and beyond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-based quests and artifact recovery, rooted in real events and figures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic world adaptation: NPCs, rituals, and weather respond to your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic presentation: rich visuals, voice narration, and orchestral score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative choices: affect how history unfolds—play observer or changer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the dusty corridors of time, solve mysteries, and decide whether to preserve history—or transform it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Aeon Tempus is a cinematic action‑adventure steeped in real history. You play a time‑traveling researcher solving mysteries across ancient civilizations—uncover artifacts, navigate political intrigue, and rewrite the past.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/36caea4b1199ce5f5e7ada9082f2c5dc999294b6/header.jpg?t=1787740374", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/30c1dc7dcc5336fefe4f9e173cb515392a1df21b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787740374", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699600/30c1dc7dcc5336fefe4f9e173cb515392a1df21b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787740374", "website": "https://www.instagram.com/ephesuscreative", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB or AMD RX 580<br></li><li><str